  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 909.06 Information to be Provided to the Medical Examiner. The driver-applicant or co-applicant shall provide the medical examiner with a description of the job tasks the driver applicant will be required to perform.\n\nSource. #8404, eff 8-2-05 (from Saf-C 908.06); ss by #10215,e ff 10-25-12; ss by #13684, eff 7-17-23",
